# Gannet Cliff (CIPlay gannet_cliff): The Lullaby Frequency's seventh island, quest "The Quiet Choir" (the library's own
# Gannet Rock is another island: this one is named Gannet Cliff). The pit gate asks for the Choir's hymn sheet, a story
# item of Effigy Shoals: the play reads it there first. The beach at -18 -50 (1 m), the cliff path up x -18 from z -44
# to -6 (13 m); the plateau at 13 m round 0 8; the pit 6 x 6 m round 0 12 (floor 8.16 m), its gate on the south rim at
# 0.75 8.25, the ladder under it; the bell at 6 -4; the store at 11 -3.
island Effigy Shoals
offset 0 0
read Choir hymn sheet
expect story hymn 1
island Gannet Cliff
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Quiet Choir
wait 3
expect hidden pitladder
walk -18 -54 to -18 -49 h=1
zone cliff_foot
expect step 1
read Choir notice board
expect step 2
walk -18 -44 to -18 -30 h=5.5
walk -18 -30 to -18 -16 h=10
walk -18 -16 to -18 -6 to -8 -4 h=13
zone tents
expect step 3
read Sister Ro
read Brother Ansel
read The Listener
expect story diary 3
expect step 4
use campbell
expect message nobody would come
use pitgate
expect shown pitladder
expect story pitopen 1
expect step 5
zone pit_floor
expect step 6
kill Hyena
expect step 7
use sermonradio
expect story sermon 1
expect step 8
open Listener's strongbox
expect story quarrychart 1
expect step 10
use campbell
expect story rung 1
expect done
storespot 11 -3
